## Complete CSS Rules from `_sub.scss`

**File:** `/c/Users/edn_y/renew_nineonelabs/resource/scss/pages/_sub.scss` (lines 165–334)

### Hero Slogan Section Styles:
```scss
.no-sub-about {
  &-hero-slogan {
    --hero-slogan-surface-alpha: 0.24;

    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, var(--hero-slogan-surface-alpha));
    backdrop-filter: blur(24px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);

    &__title {
      text-align: center;

      h2 {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: fluid(8, 16);
        line-height: 0.9;
      }

      .line {
        text-align: center;
      }
    }

    &__line {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: fluid(10, 18);
      .weak {
        opacity: 0.4;
      }
    }

    &__line.mask-target {
      display: block;

      > .masking-text {
        display: block;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      > .masking-text > .masking-text__line {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: fluid(10, 18);
      }
    }

    &__keyword-shell {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: fluid(10, 14);
      color: var(--clr-white-100);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    &__bracket {
      color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--clr-white-100) 72%, transparent);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    &__keyword-viewport {
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
      height: 0.98em;
      width: auto;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      overflow: hidden;
      vertical-align: top;
      will-change: width;
      contain: paint;
    }

    &__keyword-track {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
      will-change: transform;
    }

    &__keyword {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 0.98em;
      opacity: 0.4;
      filter: blur(8px);
      text-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);
      will-change: opacity, filter, text-shadow;
    }

    &__inner {
      min-height: var(--scene-shell-span);
      position: relative;
    }

    &__txt {
      position: sticky;
      top: var(--header-height);
      min-height: calc(100vh - var(--header-height));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: var(--gutter-4xl) 0;
    }

    > div {
      height: 100%;
    }

    &__top {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: var(--gutter-sm);
      width: 100%;
    }

    // Responsive styles for md and sm breakpoints
    @include mq(md) {
      &__title {
        h2 {
          gap: fluid(6, 10);
        }
      }

      &__line {
        gap: fluid(8, 12);
      }

      &__line.mask-target {
        > .masking-text > .masking-text__line {
          gap: fluid(8, 12);
        }
      }

      &__keyword-shell {
        gap: fluid(8, 10);
      }

      &__txt {
        min-height: calc(100vh - var(--header-height));
        padding: var(--gutter-2xl) 0;
      }
    }

    @include mq(sm) {
      &__keyword-shell {
        gap: fluid(6, 8);
      }
    }
  }
}
```

---

## Key CSS Performance Properties:

**`will-change` Properties:**
- `&__keyword-viewport`: `will-change: width;`
- `&__keyword-track`: `will-change: transform;`
- `&__keyword`: `will-change: opacity, filter, text-shadow;`

**Transform/Translate Properties:**
- `&__keyword-track`: `transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);`

**Animation-Related:**
- `&__keyword`: Uses `filter: blur(8px);` and `text-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);` for animation targets
- `&__keyword-viewport`: Uses `overflow: hidden;` + `contain: paint;` for performance

